        Controllers extend <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">BloomController</code> and manage fine-grained reactive signals:
      </p>
      <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-black/90 border border-slate-800 p-5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-200 overflow-x-auto">
        <pre class="leading-relaxed"><code>{step2Code}</code></pre>
