        Press <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-white font-mono">r</kbd> for Hot Reload, <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-white font-mono">w</kbd> for Wireless QR Code, or <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-white font-mono">d</kbd> for DevTools.
